tweets.text:
A total of 77% of companies are beating consensus Q2 EPS estimates—10 percentage points above the 10-year average—with Technology leading at 85.1%.
Notably, more than 15% of companies reporting Q2 results have raised forward guidance, versus a 10-year average of 10%. Notably, nearly one-third of Technology companies have raised guidance.
@SoberLook

